Okay, move, back, back, back, back!

1120
01:17:50,820 --> 01:17:53,820
Back back back... Back where? I forgot where I was!

1121
01:17:53,820 --> 01:17:56,320
I don't know where I was!

1122
01:17:56,320 --> 01:17:58,320
Here, maybe here I think.

1123
01:17:58,320 --> 01:18:02,320
Okay guys, whew! This year's birthday celebration was so much fun!

1124
01:18:02,320 --> 01:18:08,820
I got to go to two different location shoots, spend time with everyone, and make so many great memories.

1125
01:18:09,820 --> 01:18:14,820
So thank you, thank you so much again for making my birthday a blast!

1126
01:18:15,320 --> 01:18:18,320
You're welcome! Hug! Group hug! Bring it in!

1127
01:18:18,320 --> 01:18:21,820
Thank you!

1128
01:18:21,820 --> 01:18:23,820
Reine is one year older.

1129
01:18:23,820 --> 01:18:26,320
I'm one year older!

1130
01:18:26,320 --> 01:18:28,820
Congrats on getting closer to me.

1131
01:18:30,120 --> 01:18:32,320
Your hair is turning gray.

1132
01:18:32,320 --> 01:18:34,820
Yours is, too!

1133
01:18:34,820 --> 01:18:36,820
マジですか？
Really?

1134
01:18:36,820 --> 01:18:43,820
And now, before we know it, we've reached the final part of this stream, and it is time for the new song performance!

1135
01:18:43,820 --> 01:18:45,320
Woah!

1136
01:18:45,320 --> 01:18:49,320
Wait, hold on, I gotta show you something! I'm gonna get something!

1137
01:18:49,320 --> 01:18:51,820
What are you going to get? I'm going to get... Where is she going?

1138
01:18:51,820 --> 01:18:53,820
Is that what I think it is?

1139
01:18:53,820 --> 01:18:55,320
My beautiful beautiful baby!

1140
01:18:55,320 --> 01:18:58,320
Woah!

1141
01:18:58,320 --> 01:19:00,320
I'm back! Yay!

1142
01:19:00,320 --> 01:19:02,320
It's the Reine bass! Love the stickers!

1143
01:19:03,820 --> 01:19:06,820
Do you guys recognize these stickers? Yeah!

1144
01:19:08,820 --> 01:19:15,820
All right, I worked really really hard on this song, so I hope you all can enjoy it!

1145
01:19:16,320 --> 01:19:20,820
All right, can everyone say the title of the new song together with me?

1146
01:19:20,820 --> 01:19:22,320
Okay, let's go!

1147
01:19:22,320 --> 01:19:27,820
せーの！ Endless Blue!
One, two! Endless Blue!

1148
01:19:52,320 --> 01:20:00,820
Endless Blue
作詞：藤原優樹 作曲・編曲：長谷川大介
Endless Blue
Lyrics: Yuki Fujiwara | Music & Arr.: Daisuke Hasegawa

1149
01:20:06,508 --> 01:20:08,778
飾り付けた 言葉でなんで
Why did I hide my true heartbeat

1150
01:20:08,778 --> 01:20:11,278
本当の鼓動 隠してたんだ
behind dressed-up words?

1151
01:20:11,278 --> 01:20:13,928
折りたたんだ羽は
My folded wings

1152
01:20:13,928 --> 01:20:16,328
見えない空に焦がれてた
were yearning for a sky out of sight.

1153
01:20:16,328 --> 01:20:18,878
パズルなら壊してしまった
If it was a puzzle, I ended up breaking it,

1154
01:20:18,878 --> 01:20:21,328
散らばる欠片 バラバラ
its scattered pieces falling apart.

1155
01:20:21,328 --> 01:20:23,828
誰かに似た色じゃ
Colors that resemble someone else

1156
01:20:23,828 --> 01:20:26,828
意味がない わかってるから
are meaningless, and I know that now.

1157
01:20:26,828 --> 01:20:31,728
旅立ちは あの青空のせいだ
Blame this departure on that blue sky,

1158
01:20:31,728 --> 01:20:37,728
誤魔化せない 憧れに気づいたから
because I realized a yearning I could no longer deceive.

1159
01:20:37,728 --> 01:20:42,528
どうしようもない 衝動に駆られて
Driven by an uncontrollable impulse,

1160
01:20:42,528 --> 01:20:47,328
動き出した ストーリーの先には
ahead of this story that has begun to move,

1161
01:20:47,328 --> 01:20:52,428
不安も 物思いさえも 染めていく
it stains even my anxieties and pensive thoughts.

1162
01:20:52,428 --> 01:20:57,028
想像より今 眩い空が 広がってるはずでしょう
A sky more dazzling than imagined must be spreading out right now, isn't it?

1163
01:20:57,028 --> 01:21:01,128
扉 開け行こう
So let's open the door and go!

1164
01:21:10,328 --> 01:21:12,678
ヤミヤミ 沈む昨日も
The gloomy yesterdays that sank into darkness,

1165
01:21:12,678 --> 01:21:15,528
涙見 叫び痛む今日も
and the painful todays filled with tears and screams...

1166
01:21:15,528 --> 01:21:18,128
今更なんて言って
Saying "it's too late now,"

1167
01:21:18,128 --> 01:21:20,528
願いの色は 燻んでた
the colors of my wishes had grown smoldering and dim.

1168
01:21:20,528 --> 01:21:23,078
痛みなら 飲み干してしまおう
If it's pain, I'll swallow it whole;

1169
01:21:23,078 --> 01:21:25,528
また乗り越えてみせるよ
I'll overcome it once again.

1170
01:21:25,528 --> 01:21:27,828
私でいることに
The weakness of hesitating

1171
01:21:27,828 --> 01:21:31,128
ためらう弱さは もういらない
to just be myself—I don't need it anymore.

1172
01:21:31,128 --> 01:21:35,528
広げた羽は 飾りじゃないよ
These spread wings aren't just for decoration;

1173
01:21:35,528 --> 01:21:39,428
鮮やかな夢を纏おう
let's wrap ourselves in vivid dreams.

1174
01:21:39,428 --> 01:21:44,528
その覚悟が ここにあるから
Because that resolve is right here!

1175
01:22:02,328 --> 01:22:06,728
幻想の夜 重ねて
Piling up illusory nights,

1176
01:22:06,728 --> 01:22:10,828
ふらり 漂うように 歩いていたよ
I was wandering aimlessly, drifting along.

1177
01:22:10,828 --> 01:22:15,928
途方もなく遠くて 挫けそうになっても
Even if it seemed endlessly far and I felt like breaking down,

1178
01:22:15,928 --> 01:22:19,828
この声は 羽ばたける
this voice of mine

1179
01:22:19,828 --> 01:22:23,528
その時を待っていたんだ
was waiting for the moment to take flight.

1180
01:22:23,528 --> 01:22:28,428
もう一度 叫んでみるよ
I'll try crying it out once more!

1181
01:22:28,428 --> 01:22:33,628
終わりなんてない 旅を続けたくて
Wanting to continue this endless journey,

1182
01:22:33,628 --> 01:22:38,328
進んでいく ストーリーの向こうへと
beyond the story moving steadily forward,

1183
01:22:38,328 --> 01:22:43,528
この声で 果てない空を渡っていく
with this voice, I will cross the boundless sky.

1184
01:22:43,528 --> 01:22:47,828
まだ知らない 遥かな青に 胸を膨らませて
My heart swelling with excitement for the distant blue yet unknown,

1185
01:22:47,828 --> 01:22:54,628
無限の明日が きっと待ってるから
because a boundless tomorrow is surely waiting for me,

1186
01:22:54,628 --> 01:22:58,528
扉 開け行こう
let's open the door and go!

